	<key>NSBluetoothAlwaysUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Bluetooth may be used to connect optional peripherals during workouts. This is optional and only used when you connect a device.</string>
	<key>NSCalendarsUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Calendar access is requested only if you choose to save scheduled workouts or reminders to your calendar.</string>
	<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
	<string>HealthPulse Health uses the camera to track posture and estimate calories during workouts you choose to start.</string>
	<key>NSContactsUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Contacts access is optional and only used when you explicitly choose to share progress with a contact.</string>
	<key>NSHealthShareUsageDescription</key>
	<string>HealthPulse Health reads select Health data (steps, heart rate, activity) only when you opt in so we can provide personalized insights. You can revoke access any time in Health settings.</string>
	<key>NSHealthUpdateUsageDescription</key>
	<string>HealthPulse Health saves your workouts and calories burned to Health app so data stays synced.</string>
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Location helps track outdoor workouts and personalize in-app stats.</string>
	<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Microphone enables voice commands so you can control workouts hands-free.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryAddUsageDescription</key>
	<string>We request permission only if you choose to save images generated or annotated within the app to your photo library.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Photo library access lets you save and share your fitness progress photos.</string>
	<key>NSSpeechRecognitionUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Speech recognition helps convert voice commands to actions on workout and meditation screens.</string>
	<key>NSUserNotificationUsageDescription</key>
	<string>This app uses notifications to remind you about important events.</string>
